召唤仪式了，都失败了。不是我说，这次她必然也失败。要是她那样都能当召唤师啊，哼，我就把我的名字倒着念。”校长信誓旦旦的说着。“校长，你这话，可当真？！”凌飞扬的表情凝重前来，漂亮的眉毛皱了起来，口气变的非常不满，有些恼羞的说道，“怎会如此？诸葛师伯岂不是会很伤心。唉，这可如何是好？我受诸葛师伯的托付前来照看诸葛妹妹的。校长，诸葛家可是传承百年的大族。现在诸葛妹妹居然落到这般境地，是否是你们教导有问题？”话到最后，语气已经有了质问的意思。校长额头的冷汗开始飙了……他擦了擦冷汗，心中那叫一个纠结。凌少啊，你到底是什么意思啊？到底是关心诸葛明月呢？还是讥讽她啊？这到底是什么意思啊啊啊啊？有没有人能告诉他啊？刚才还那副不屑的样子，现在却是这样关切和痛心的口气。这转变，让校长彻底懵了。旁边的几位老师也傻眼了，他们也搞不懂这凌飞扬葫芦里到底卖的什么药了。骆惊风眼角余光瞟了眼凌飞扬嘴角的那丝不易察觉的笑意，心中暗骂，贱人！再这样逗下去，校长会发疯吧。“啊，凌少，看，那个诸葛明月在那里呢。就是那个穿灰衣服的。”忽然，之前那个老师像发现什么不得了的事情一般，伸手指着广场上背对着他们的诸葛明月。“哦？那个么？”凌飞扬的注意力被吸引了过去。校长又擦了擦额头的冷汗，这次确定擦干净了，转头冲那个老师投了感激加赏识的微笑。干的好，这个月奖金丰厚。谢谢校长，应该的。那老师回了这么个眼神。“对对，就是她。她的衣服全部是灰色和黑色的。”那老师猛点头，确定着，“那个背影，就是她。”“哦，背影看起来还不错嘛。头发没你们说的那么乱啊。”凌飞扬靠在椅背上，懒洋洋的说道，“这次，她也召唤不出魔宠的吧？”“这个，这个……”有了之前的教训，校长支支吾吾半天都没有说出话来。“这个，要看机缘吧。也许能，也许不能。”又是那个老师机警的接话了。这话，说的好听，也等于没说。但是，不得罪人。“哦，我看她那样，这辈子也别想成为召唤师了。”凌飞扬轻笑一声，淡淡的说道。校长和那名老师对视一眼，现在确定了，凌飞扬不待见诸葛家的人！因为，话说的这样重，这辈子！“是啊，凌少说的对，那样的人怎么可能成为召唤师？”校长急忙马屁的说道。“凌少慧眼如炬，她绝对不可能成为召唤师的。”那老师也不甘落后，一记马屁送上。凌飞扬挑眉，看着诸葛明月的背影，冷哼一声。“话不要说的这么死。倘若她能成为召唤师呢？”一直没有开口的骆惊风终于开口凉凉的说了一句话。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 Young Master Ling and Young Master Luo Zhuge Mingyue was recalling the spell. She was unaware that the people around her suddenly became violent. This wave of excitement was caused by the sudden appearance of two people in the stands. Two young men. The principal and several teachers were greeting me enthusiastically. These two people are not ordinary people. Both were disciples of nobles in the capital. One of their families was the famous Ling family, and the other was the powerful Luo family. Ling Feiyang is now an extremely powerful swordsman. He has been promoted to the Earth Swordsman at a young age. It was very popular for a while. And his appearance made countless girls fall in love with him. Exquisite and unparalleled face, ice blue eyes, long black hair, charming smile, and polite attitude towards women. His good friend Luo Jingfeng's personality is completely opposite to his. Cold, powerful, and unpretentious towards women. Like Ling Feiyang, his appearance, his grace, his strength, and his background are also attracted by many girls. At this moment, many people looked at the two people in the stands excitedly. Young Master Ling and Young Master Luo are well-known and sought-after masters in their generation. Why did it appear in a small town like theirs now? Zhuge Mingyue turned her back to the stands, completely unaware of the current situation. She was concentrating on recalling the spell. In the stands, Ling Feiyang and Luo Jingfeng enjoyed the refreshments prepared for them by the college and commented on the students below. \"By the way, principal, I remember that so-and-so from the Zhuge family seemed to go to school here.\" Ling Feiyang elegantly picked up the tea cup and glanced lightly below. \"Mr. Ling, her name is Zhuge Mingyue, she's the one with the messy hair... Hey, why is she missing?\" There was a teacher next to her who said flatteringly, but mid-sentence, she looked down and was dumbfounded. No one could see the person with his hair as messy as a chicken coop. Originally, Zhuge Mingyue's messy hair was the best mark, allowing people to see her at a glance in the crowd. However, today the teacher did not find the existence of Chicken Cot Head. \"Oh, you didn't come to participate in the summoning ceremony? Don't all the people from the academy have to attend every summoning ceremony? This is the rule of the empire. Does your White Feather Academy violate the rules of the empire?\" Ling Feiyang spat out a few words lazily, which successfully made the principals and teachers in the stands change their expressions. Luo Jingfeng glanced at Ling Feiyang, who had a lazy look on his face, with disdain in his heart. This bitch is scaring people again. Didn't you see that the principal is so old? His face turned blue. What if something goes wrong? \"That's impossible. She doesn't dare not come to participate. I'll ask someone to go and see for herself. Maybe she's still in the classroom.\" The principal wiped the cold sweat from his forehead and replied anxiously. \"That's not necessary.\" Ling Feiyang replied lazily, \"I'm just asking casually. What about Zhuge, what are his qualifications? Is he a summoner, a swordsman, or an archer?\" The cold sweat that the principal had just wiped off broke out again, and he weakly replied: \"None of them.\" \"What do you mean?\" Ling Feiyang turned to look at the principal who looked worried. \"She is here to participate in her third summoning ceremony today. She does not have the qualifications of a swordsman or an archer.\" The principal answered carefully after considering it. The relationships between the major aristocratic families in the capital are complicated. On the surface, they may appear to be on good terms, but behind the scenes, they may be fighting to the death. The principal was not sure what the relationship between the Ling family and the Zhuge family was, and he was also not sure what Ling Feiyang meant by asking, so he thought for a while before answering. Unexpectedly, after hearing this, Ling Feiyang was stunned for a moment, and then burst out laughing in a very shameless manner. However, his smile did not make people feel impolite, but instead gave people a sense of uninhibited charm. When the principal saw Ling Feiyang's attitude, and because Ling Feiyang had not been able to call Zhuge Mingyue by his name before, but instead called him Zhuge, the principal firmly believed that the Ling family and the Zhuge family must be friendly on the surface but dissatisfied behind the scenes. Therefore, he became a little unscrupulous and said in a flattering tone: \"Master Ling, you don't know, Zhuge Mingyue is really troublesome. She usually wears messy hair, which affects the image of the college. Just talking about her qualifications, it is really embarrassing. She carries the most basic knowledge. She can't even recite the simplest spells. She has participated in the summoning ceremony twice and failed. I don't mean that she will fail this time. If she can be a summoner like that, I will read my name backwards. \"Principal, are you serious about what you said?!\" Ling Feiyang came forward with a solemn expression, his beautiful eyebrows furrowed, his tone became very dissatisfied, and he said with some irritation, \"How could this be so? Master Zhuge wouldn't be very sad. Oh, what should we do? I was entrusted by Master Zhuge to take care of Sister Zhuge. Principal, the Zhuge family has been a long-established family. Now that Sister Zhuge is in this situation, is there something wrong with your teachings?\" At the end of his words, his tone was questioning. The cold sweat on the principal's forehead began to break out... He wiped the cold sweat, feeling a tangle in his heart. Mr. Ling, what on earth do you mean? Do you care about Zhuge Mingyue? Or are you mocking her? What on earth does this mean? Can anyone tell him? The look of disdain just now was now such a concerned and distressed tone. This change completely confused the principal. Several teachers nearby were also dumbfounded. They couldn't figure out what kind of medicine was sold in Ling Feiyang's gourd. From the corner of his eye, Luo Jingfeng glanced at the imperceptible smile on Ling Feiyang's lips, and cursed in his heart, bitch! If you continue teasing like this, the principal will go crazy. \"Ah, Mr. Ling, look, that Zhuge Mingyue is there. It's the one in gray clothes.\" Suddenly, that person from before", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}